00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.301
So here's one quick question.

00:00:10.571 --> 00:00:12.719
How much did you actually keep last month?

00:00:12.989 --> 00:00:14.801
Not what came in. What you kept.

00:00:15.701 --> 00:00:17.170
It doesn't matter what you run.

